OL,3,GNEWSATeen drowned in river trying to
OL,4,Asave friends - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has heard how a 14-year-old
OL,7,Fboy drowned after going to the aid of
OL,8,Ftwo friends in a tributary of the River
OL,9,FThames.
OL,11,FBaltazar Da Costa, who was born in
OL,12,FTimor-Leste and lived in Stanford in
OL,13,Fthe Vale in Oxfordshire, was among at
OL,14,Fleast 11 people who died in
OL,15,Fwater-related incidents during the
OL,16,Fheatwave across the country at the end
OL,17,Fof May.
OL,19,FThames Valley Police was called to the
OL,20,Friver near Donnington Bridge at about
OL,21,F17:30 BST on 27 May.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
