OL,3,GNEWSATeen drowned in river trying to
OL,4,Asave friends - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquest at Oxford Coroner's Court
OL,7,Fheard that Baltazar, who could not
OL,8,Fswim, died at the scene.
